# The amino-skills revision this repo's conformance run is executed FROM.
#
# security-gate.yml used to `git clone --depth 1` whatever amino-skills main happened
# to be and then run conformance/run.mjs from it. Two problems with that: the corpus
# this repo is judged against could change without a commit here, and — the reason it
# is pinned rather than merely fetched carefully — anything landing on that repo's main
# EXECUTES on this runner, unreviewed, at the moment it lands.
#
# Bump deliberately, in the change that reconciles this engine with that revision.
# amino-site carries the same file for the same reason (.github/amino-skills.pin).
3ddef17ac15a433ff17bb4f9ebbd3bc787176bbf
